! Test 12: OH radical UHF/LANL2DZ - analytical hessian (UHF + ECP)
! Open-shell system with ECP on O
%method  HF
%basis   lanl2dz
%ecp     lanl2dz
%job     freq
%hess_method analytical
%spin    unrestricted
%mult    2
*geometry angstrom
 O    0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
 H    0.000000    0.000000    0.970000
*end
